13104-7","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"choice","speaker":"화자 미지정","text":"전 게임하는 거 좋아요","talkId":403055013,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-8","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"간단히 얘기하면, 주사위야","talkId":403055007,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-9"],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916,"bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-5"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-9","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"잘 모르겠다고? 직접 해보면 알 거야","talkId":403055008,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-10","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"시뮬레이션 우주에 쓸데없는 데이터가 너무 많거든. 이렇게 멀리까지 온 너도 에이언즈를 본 건 몇 번뿐이지? 게다가 얘기할 기회도 별로 없었잖아, 불쌍해라","talkId":403055010,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-11"],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916,"bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-6"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-11","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"그래서 우주의 시간을 특정 역사의 단편 속에 고정해서 범위를 축소할 거야, 에이언즈 연구에도 도움이 되겠지. 근데 널 어떤 앰버기원으로 보내야 할지는 나도 잘 모르겠어——","talkId":403055011,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-12"],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-12","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"뭐, 완•매는 자기 생각이 있는 모양이야. 「충황」 타이츠론스가 몰락하기 전 시대로 고정하겠대","talkId":403055012,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-13","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"그럼 다행이네, 난 별로거든","talkId":403055014,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8013104/Act/Act403055000.json","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"matched","bwikiScene":"6eb92b535b7469ed","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-14"],"bwikiPage":"寰宇蝗灾：开启","bwikiRevision":71916},{"id":"swarm-disaster-quest-8013104-quest-8013104-14","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"quest-8013104","missionId":"quest-8013104","mission":"곤충 떼 재난: 시작","scene":"헤르타 · 아, [개척자], 요즘 좀 어때?","t